                                        "entry_id": "5fe7644d-5739-34cd-83ad-2233f943bcb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A disorder characterized by appetite and craving for non-edible substances, such as chalk, clay, dirt, ice, or sand."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
