                                                "sense_id": "ed184c22-8442-3bc6-8a53-915508736a4a",
                                                "text": "The three most common nonfood picas were eating of strings and rags; feces, vomit, and urine; and paper, cigarettes, and soil."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
